@startuml
actor Client
participant SourceCodeFile
participant SecurityAuditVisitor
Client -> SourceCodeFile: accept(securityVisitor)
activate SourceCodeFile
SourceCodeFile -> SecurityAuditVisitor: visit(this)
activate SecurityAuditVisitor
SecurityAuditVisitor -> SecurityAuditVisitor: inspect risk and credentials
SecurityAuditVisitor --> SourceCodeFile: return
 deactivate SecurityAuditVisitor
SourceCodeFile --> Client: return
 deactivate SourceCodeFile
Client -> SecurityAuditVisitor: report()
SecurityAuditVisitor --> Client: formatted findings
@enduml
